      "expectedPath": "/api/{tool}/tasks/:taskId/recovery",
      "status": "missing",
      "reason": "Nothing renders it yet. The read exists (1.31, 2026-09-21) and carries the three verbs of the recovery surface: the run's bounded step history with SQL totals over all of it, the leftover checkout with what discarding it would lose, and whether a resume or a discard is available and why not. The screen offering resume / view partial / discard is the remaining half of the item."
